 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Rough drawing gives it that charm. You can always smooth later. Try rough lines, almost hiding them with thick pencil lines. Then quick drawing exercise. Pick something you see, like a cup, and draw it really quickly, over and over. It improves eye hand coordination. Find a window where the sun is coming in, or use rough pencil on paper bag. Draw the window mirror instead, so the drawing isn't directly in view. It is. But it' worth it. Ten minutes of quick draws helps lots.",
